Set Time Out
(1=100ms)



Set message length to 5 bytes
This the length of the EMIS data.



Initiate a comms exchange when the data needs to be refreshed




The Transmit length must be written every time a new exchange is initiated as is gets overwritten by the received data length.



DATA_EXCH instruction
