					<textBox width="70" height="13">==========================================================================================================================================
FUNCTION BLOCK -	BMENOC0301
==========================================================================================================================================
Description:		BME NOC0301 Ethernet Communications Module Status
Date Changed:		14/01/2026
Change Comments:	Changed iStsDDT Type from T_BMENOC0301_3 to T_BMENOC0301_4
Revision:		1.11

==========================================================================================================================================
Copyright Rio Tinto Pty Ltd, 2026
==========================================================================================================================================<objPosition posX="0" posY="0"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="9" height="2">ETH2 Port Function
    <objPosition posX="56" posY="366"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="9" height="2">In Error Count
    <objPosition posX="28" posY="475"></objPosition>
