					<textBox width="100" height="4">Sequence Status Word Mapping
==========================
Sequence Enabled,   Sequence Stopping,   Sequence Disabled
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="94"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="100" height="4">Drive Status
=======================
This section includes the logic for run hours accumulation and the building of mode, status and sequence words for HMI display.
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="0"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="100" height="4">Drive Auto and Ready
==========================
Create the Auto Ready status, use to allow dependent equipment to start
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="159"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="100" height="4">Mode Word Mapping
==================
The drive modes are mapped into a word for HMI display. The modes are mutually exclusive.
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="18"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="100" height="4">Drive Re-Start Required
==========================
If the drive is required by the sequence, it's stopped and healthy then a restart is required
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="140"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="100" height="14">Status Word Mapping
==================
The status are mapped into a word for HMI display. The status are not mutually exclusive.

Bit        Descripton                   
=================================
Bit 0     Drive Stopped
Bit 1     Drive Started
Bit 2     Drive Run Up
Bit 14     Drive Tripped
Bit 15     Drive Trip Acknowledged
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="45"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="9" height="3">%S6 System 500ms Square Wave
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="11"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="100" height="3">Run Minutes
==========
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="5"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
				</networkFBD>
			</FBDSource>
		</FBProgram>
	</FBSource>
