					<textBox width="80" height="10">Revision History
==============================================================================================================================================================
1.00	KA	24/09/2024	Initial Release
1.10 	KA	26/09/2024	Added User input functionality to set the pulse time/DOW/Day
1.11	AXY	7/11/2024		Added Minute Setpoint
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="50"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="9" height="2">Shift 2 Hour
    <objPosition posX="90" posY="156"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="2">Shift Pulse
    <objPosition posX="71" posY="240"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="3">Minute Equal To Set Time
    <objPosition posX="71" posY="199"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="90" height="5">PLC Local Time
**************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************
CPU Local Time is Taken from PLC System Words
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="66"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="2">Day of Month
    <objPosition posX="65" posY="140"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="80" height="13">==============================================================================================================================================================
FUNCTION BLOCK		StatPls
==============================================================================================================================================================
Description:		Totaliser Digital Pulse Generation
Date Changed:		24/09/2024
Change Comments:	Initial Release
Revision:		1.00

==============================================================================================================================================================
Copyright Rio TInto Pty Ltd, 2020
==============================================================================================================================================================
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="0"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="2">Month Pulse
    <objPosition posX="71" posY="230"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="5">Second Shift is set to 12 hrs after. select 24hr time format.
    <objPosition posX="80" posY="168"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="90" height="5">Defaults
**************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************
Set Defaults
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="132"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="90" height="4">Get the Local Date &amp; Time
Note:  This is different to %SW49-53, which hold the time in UTC (Universal Coordinated Time).
    <objPosition posX="10" posY="76"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="9" height="2">Shift 1
    <objPosition posX="10" posY="240"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="9" height="2">Shift 2
    <objPosition posX="10" posY="253"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="2">Day of Week
    <objPosition posX="25" posY="140"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="2">12 Hour Shifts
    <objPosition posX="90" posY="140"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="90" height="5">Pulse Output
**************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************
Pulse Outputs generated based on a given period
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="190"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="3">Hour Equal to Set Time
    <objPosition posX="51" posY="199"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="2">Day Pulse
    <objPosition posX="71" posY="210"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="80" height="35">Description:
==============================================================================================================================================================
Produces Digital Pulses repeatedly at the Start of a Shift (12 Hour periods), Daily, Weekly, and Monthly Time periods for TotaliserPulseStat DFB.
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="14"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="2">Week Pulse
    <objPosition posX="71" posY="220"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
				</networkFBD>
			</FBDSource>
		</FBProgram>
	</FBSource>
