					<textBox width="100" height="4">Limit Switch Fault
==============
The Limit Switch Fault occurs when both the open and close proximity switches are on simultaneously.
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="4"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="100" height="6">Fail to Open or Close
=================
The Fail to Open or Close alarm occurs when:
     a. The valve fails to open / close within the iFltDlyTm; or
     b. The valve is already opened / closed and the open / close signal is lost when it has not been issued a close / open command.
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="17"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="100" height="3">FAULTS
=======
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="0"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="19" height="2">Limit failure when open has been achieved
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="31"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
