						</linkDestination>
					</linkFB>
					<textBox width="50" height="4">Description:
==================================================================================================
The Unpack32 object is used to unpack bits 0 through 31 from a packed DWORD to individual bits.
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="14"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="50" height="2">Unmap the data from the DWORD to the individual channel statuses
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="28"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="50" height="8">Revision History
==================================================================================================
1.00	BCY	9/07/2020	Initial Release
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="19"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="50" height="13">==================================================================================================
FUNCTION BLOCK - Unpack32
==================================================================================================
Description:	      Packed DWORD 32 Channel Unpacking 	
Date Changed:	      9/07/2020
Change Comments:      Initial Release
Revision:	       1.00

==================================================================================================
Copyright Rio TInto Pty Ltd, 2020
==================================================================================================
