					<textBox width="130" height="3">Channel 0
    <objPosition posX="10" posY="45"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="140" height="16">Description:
==============================================================================================================================================================================================================================================
This DFB is used to write the analogue outputs and HART commands to a BME AHO0412 4 Channel HART Analogue Output module.

The DFB satisfies the following requirements:
• Scale and write the analogue output values;
• Reset channels to accept changes in HART instruments; and
• Enable channels.

The BME AHO0412 module must be configured as detailed in the X80_AHO0412In DFB.

This DFB is designed to work with an associated X80_AHO0412In DFB.
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="14"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="140" height="13">==============================================================================================================================================================================================================================================
FUNCTION BLOCK -	X80_AHO0412Out
==============================================================================================================================================================================================================================================
Description:		X80 BME AHO0412 4 Channel HART Analogue Output Module Mapping &amp; HART Commands
