    <objPosition posX="0" posY="0"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="130" height="3">Channel 1
    <objPosition posX="10" posY="75"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="140" height="5">Map the analogue output channel data to the T_U_ANA_STD_OUT_4 Device DDT. 

The output channels are not masked by the module health as this should to be managed by the logic external to the DFB. This allows outputs to continue being controlled in the event not all channels fail.
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="39"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="130" height="3">Channel 3
    <objPosition posX="10" posY="135"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="140" height="7">Revision History
==============================================================================================================================================================================================================================================
1.00	BCY	26/5/2023	Initial Release
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="31"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
				</networkFBD>
			</FBDSource>
