					<textBox width="121" height="13">Reset healthy and enabled HART channels upon detecting a major or minor change in instrument to accept the new HART instrument.

Bits 0 and 1 of ChSts is Channel Healthy and Channel Enabled statuses respectively, set in X80_AHO0412In DFB.
Bits 3 and 4 of HART ChSts is Channel Instrument Changed, Minor and Channel Instrument Changed, Major statuses respectively, set in X80_AHO0412In DFB.

oHARTDDT.G_ResetChanged_ID
Bit 0: CH-0 Reset
Bit 1: CH-1 Reset
Bit 2: CH-2 Reset
Bit 3: CH-3 Reset
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="5"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="120" height="11">Enable HART channels based on module configuration. 

Bit 1 of ChSts is Channel Enable setting, set in X80_AHO0412In DFB.

oHARTDDT.G_Enable_ID
Bit 0: CH-0 Enable
Bit 1: CH-1 Enable
Bit 2: CH-2 Enable
Bit 3: CH-3 Enable
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="57"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
				</networkFBD>
